  "goodToKnow": "Herausragend means outstanding or excellent: eine herausragende Leistung, herausragend gut. It's the present participle of herausragen (to stick out, stand out). Its close synonym is hervorragend, which is the top phrase on German job references: Sie hat ihre Aufgaben stets zu unserer vollsten Zufriedenheit und hervorragend erledigt. Both are strong praise; Germans use them more sparingly than English speakers use amazing."
